@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Accept / Decline Invitation

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Supplier Portal
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Accept or decline an invitation.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Supplier (own company only, Admin-approved)

ROUTE: /Supplier/Invitations/Respond/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- POST Accept / Decline for an own, Pending invitation
  before the deadline; notify the Officer; audit.

DEPENDENCIES:
TenderInvitations, Notifications, AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Every query must be filtered by the signed-in user’s
SupplierId. Never show other suppliers’ invitations, offers,
prices or evaluations.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Accept / Decline Invitation";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Invitations";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Tell the Sourcing Officer whether your company will submit an offer.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<div class="pg-grid">
<partial name="_ConfirmAction" model='new ConfirmActionModel("Accept invitation", "Confirm that your company intends to submit an offer.", "Sets the invitation to Accepted and RespondedAt (UTC).", false, false)' />
<partial name="_ConfirmAction" model='new ConfirmActionModel("Decline invitation", "Decline this invitation.", "Sets the invitation to Declined. Your company cannot submit an offer in this round.", true, true)' />
</div>

<aside class="pg-note"><strong>Ignoring an invitation</strong><p>If you do nothing, the invitation stays Pending and no offer is created.</p></aside>
